   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "API\n\nGraph.apply(episode)\nGraph.link(tenant, node_ids)\nGraph.drop(subgraph)\n\nGraph.search(tenant, question,\n  vector, sources, k, hops, at)\nGraph.neighbours(node_id, at)\nGraph.history(node_id)\n\n\u2192 GraphHit, Fact, Change",
   "originalText": "API\n\nGraph.apply(episode)\nGraph.link(tenant, node_ids)\nGraph.drop(subgraph)\n\nGraph.search(tenant, question,\n  vector, sources, k, hops, at)\nGraph.neighbours(node_id, at)\nGraph.history(node_id)\n\n\u2192 GraphHit, Fact, Change",
